901416a0f/ss_02cfbe5fb32b1ce1456168f324a9616901416a0f.600x338.jpg?t=1773254177"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/6297ebf6ab48a11f5312bb3656f0788c55b42d93/ss_6297ebf6ab48a11f5312bb3656f0788c55b42d93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773254177","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/6297ebf6ab48a11f5312bb3656f0788c55b42d93/ss_6297ebf6ab48a11f5312bb3656f0788c55b42d93.600x338.jpg?t=1773254177"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/7c3f0949db358498300ce767341bc1c797a780f3/ss_7c3f0949db358498300ce767341bc1c797a780f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773254177","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/7c3f0949db358498300ce767341bc1c797a780f3/ss_7c3f0949db358498300ce767341bc1c797a780f3.600x338.jpg?t=1773254177"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/623d12fd3414ab1cc3ce8521cf944e7be3647573/ss_623d12fd3414ab1cc3ce8521cf944e7be3647573.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773254177","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316610/623d12fd3414ab1cc3ce8521cf944e7be3647573/ss_623d12fd3414ab1cc3ce8521cf944e7be3647573.600x338.jpg?t=1773254177"}],"short_description":"Aboard your ship, exterminate the enemies of profit, exploit planets and expand the corporation\u2019s commercial empire across the stars. Orium is a roguelite infused with streamlined 4X elements.","steam_appid":3316610,"support_info":{"email":"orium.community@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French","type":"game","website":null}